{"seq":6,"slug":"epistemology","title":"认识论","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 认识论 简介\n\n认识论是哲学中研究知识的本质、来源、范围和限度的核心分支。它追问\"什么是知识\"\"我们如何获得知识\"\"知识的可靠性如何保障\"等根本问题。对于程序员而言，认识论的训练能够帮助你更批判性地评估信息的可靠性，在不确定性中做出更理性的判断，并理解人工智能系统在\"知道\"和\"理解\"方面的根本局限。\n\n本知识库面向希望提升认知严谨性和批判性思维能力的中高级程序员。认识论的核心价值在于让你对\"我知道\"这三个字的分量有更深刻的理解。\n\n第1章**知识的本质**从\"什么是知识\"这一最基本的问题出发，介绍经典的JTB定义、盖梯尔问题、知识的类型分类和认知规范，帮助你建立对知识概念的精确理解。\n\n第2章**怀疑论与辩护**探讨怀疑论的挑战以及知识辩护的主要理论，涵盖笛卡尔怀疑论、基础主义、融贯论和可靠主义等认识论中最核心的立场之争。\n\n第3章**科学认识论**将认识论应用于科学知识的分析，涵盖认知美德、证言与信任、贝叶斯认识论和自然化认识论等主题，帮助你理解科学知识获取过程中的认识论基础。\n\n第4章**社会认识论**探讨知识的社会维度，涵盖集体知识、认知不公正、信息茧房和数字认识论等当代前沿议题，这些讨论与信息时代的知识传播和AI系统的认识论地位密切相关。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习。知识的本质和怀疑论与辩护建立理论基础，科学认识论深化对知识获取的理解，社会认识论则将视角扩展到信息时代的知识生态。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nature-of-knowledge","title":"知识的本质","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"justified-true-belief","title":"确证的真信念","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge/justified-true-belief"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gettier-problem","title":"盖梯尔问题","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge/gettier-problem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-types","title":"知识的类型","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge/knowledge-types"},{"seq":4,"slug":"epistemic-norms","title":"认知规范","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge/epistemic-norms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"skepticism-justification","title":"怀疑论与辩护","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/skepticism-justification","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cartesian-skepticism","title":"笛卡尔怀疑论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/skepticism-justification/cartesian-skepticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"foundationalism","title":"基础主义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/skepticism-justification/foundationalism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coherentism","title":"融贯论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/skepticism-justification/coherentism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"reliabilism","title":"可靠主义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/skepticism-justification/reliabilism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-epistemology","title":"科学认识论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/scientific-epistemology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"epistemic-virtues","title":"认知德性","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/scientific-epistemology/epistemic-virtues"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testimony-and-trust","title":"证词与信任","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/scientific-epistemology/testimony-and-trust"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bayesian-epistemology","title":"贝叶斯认识论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/scientific-epistemology/bayesian-epistemology"},{"seq":4,"slug":"naturalized-epistemology","title":"自然化认识论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/scientific-epistemology/naturalized-epistemology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"social-epistemology","title":"社会认识论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/social-epistemology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collective-knowledge","title":"集体知识","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/social-epistemology/collective-knowledge"},{"seq":2,"slug":"epistemic-injustice","title":"认知不正义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/social-epistemology/epistemic-injustice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"echo-chambers","title":"回声室与认知泡沫","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/social-epistemology/echo-chambers"},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-epistemology","title":"数字认识论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/epistemology/social-epistemology/digital-epistemology"}]}]}